# Packaging is controlled entirely by the "files" allowlist in package.json.
#
# This file is intentionally rules-only-comments. It exists so that npm does
# not fall back to .gitignore as the ignore source, because .gitignore excludes
# dist/ and build/ - artifacts the published package depends on.
#
# Do not add exclude rules here. Version 0.1.2 published a package that could
# not be loaded at all: this file excluded src/ and build/, while dist/gf.js
# requires ../build/Release/node_rs_accelerate.node and the addon can only be
# built from the sources under src/native/. Express what ships as an allowlist
# in package.json instead, where omissions are visible.
